	"博士的鬼魂|多一分不行,少一分也不行。十五年的婚姻我都没算明白……这个比例,倒让你算出来了。": "Doctor's Ghost|Not a drop more, not a drop less. Fifteen years of marriage and I never figured it out... and you worked out this ratio.",
	"弟子1号|(他慢慢转过头,盯着你)……你的头发,很多啊。": "Disciple #1|(He slowly turns his head and stares at you) ...You have a lot of hair.",
	"弟子1号|2000 年。我还是个学生。压力大到,头发一把一把地掉。": "Disciple #1|2000. I was still a student. The pressure was so bad my hair came out in handfuls.",
	"弟子1号|……我有那么显老吗?!": "Disciple #1|...Do I really look that old?!",
	"弟子1号|多一分不行,少一分也不行……原来,缺的是这个。我们试了整整一年……": "Disciple #1|Not a drop more, not a drop less... So this was what was missing. We tried for a whole year...",
	"弟子1号|我向喜欢的女孩表白。她说——她接受不了爷孙恋。": "Disciple #1|I confessed to the girl I liked. She said — she wasn't into dating her grandpa.",
	"弟子1号|我的老师……他有什么错?": "Disciple #1|My teacher... what did he ever do wrong?",
	"弟子1号|我躲起来研究生发剂。好不容易遇到了老师……可这个世界,连他也带走了。": "Disciple #1|I hid away and studied hair tonics. I finally found my teacher... and this world took him too.",
	"弟子1号|所以,我要让所有人都变得和我们一样。这才公平。": "Disciple #1|So I'll make everyone just like us. That's what's fair.",
	"弟子1号|错的是这个世界。这个世界,糟糕透了。": "Disciple #1|It's the world that's wrong. This world is rotten.",
	"扶手上贴着小牌:“候诊区。请勿在此脱发。”\n牌子下面,积了一层头发。": "A small sign on the armrest: \"Waiting area. Please do not shed here.\"\nUnder the sign, a layer of hair.",
	"是一个秃头的男人。": "It's a bald man.",
	"气味诡异,但喷一下居然让人精神一振。成分表第一行:米诺地尔。恢复 2 点状态。": "Smells strange, but one spray is weirdly refreshing. First ingredient on the label: minoxidil. Restores 2 points.",
	"水样检测报告": "Water Sample Report",
	"老收音机,调在一个不存在的频道上。旋钮上积满了灰。": "An old radio, tuned to a station that doesn't exist. The dials are thick with dust.",
	"镜子已经碎了。镜框里只剩锯齿状的玻璃。\n(打碎它的,大概是一位有容貌焦虑的科学家鬼魂。很合理。)": "The mirror is broken. Only jagged glass is left in the frame.\n(Probably smashed by a scientist's ghost with body-image issues. Makes sense.)",
	"镜子里的人,不是你。": "The person in the mirror isn't you.",
	"复古画面(PS1 风格)": "Retro graphics (PS1 style)",
	"查看墙上的字": "Examine the writing on the wall",
	"墙上用血写着:“HE IS STILL IN HERE.”\n……字迹还没干透。": "Written on the wall in blood: \"HE IS STILL IN HERE.\"\n...It isn't dry yet.",
	"[b]2025.3.14[/b]\n\n值得铭记的一天。第一版配方完成。诺贝尔奖,我来了。\nScrew you, Sarah.\n\n我在一个只要交钱就能发论文的网站上,认识了一个年轻人。他也秃,也焦虑,也被这个世界嫌弃。\n我叫他弟子1号。我们会一起证明:秃头,不是我们的错。": "[b]2025.3.14[/b]\n\nA day to remember. Formula version one is done. Nobel Prize, here I come.\nScrew you, Sarah.\n\nOn a journal website that publishes anything if you pay, I met a young man. Bald too. Anxious too. Shunned by this world too.\nI call him Disciple #1. Together we'll prove that being bald is not our fault.",
	"[b]2025.8.13[/b]\n\n不对劲。\n头发在长,可别的地方也在长。手背、后颈、耳朵里。今天早上,我的眉毛和鬓角连成了一片。\n弟子1号说这是“副作用”。不,这是嘲笑。\n\n停用一段时间吧。": "[b]2025.8.13[/b]\n\nSomething is wrong.\nMy hair is growing, but so is everything else. The backs of my hands, my neck, inside my ears. This morning my eyebrows met my sideburns.\nDisciple #1 calls it a \"side effect.\" No. It's mockery.\n\nI'll stop for a while.",
	"[b]感谢信[/b]\n\n尊敬的 Cliché 实验室:\n自贵司开业以来,本店营业额增长 [b]400%[/b]。\n为表谢意,随信附赠本店新品“春风”系列假发一顶。\n期待长期合作。\n\n—— 柳湾假发城\n\n[i](“400%”被红笔圈了三圈。旁边写着:“我们到底在帮谁?”)[/i]": "[b]Thank-You Letter[/b]\n\nDear Cliché Laboratory,\nSince you opened, our sales have grown by [b]400%[/b].\nAs a token of thanks, please accept a wig from our new \"Spring Breeze\" collection.\nWe look forward to a long partnership.\n\n— Willow Bend Wig World\n\n[i](\"400%\" has been circled three times in red pen. Next to it: \"Who are we actually helping?\")[/i]",
	"[b]致 Cliché 实验室负责人[/b]\n\n您好。\n本人是柳湾镇“老周理发”的店主,经营三十一年。\n自今年春天起,本店客人减少了 94%。剩下的 6%,是来问能不能退卡的。\n恳请贵司核查排放情况。\n\n此致\n敬礼\n\n附:本店已改为“老周帽子店”。欢迎贵司员工惠顾,凭工牌九折。": "[b]To the Director of Cliché Laboratory[/b]\n\nGood day.\nI am the owner of Old Zhou's Barbershop in Willow Bend, in business for thirty-one years.\nSince this spring, our customers have dropped by 94%. The remaining 6% come in to ask for refunds on their prepaid cards.\nI respectfully ask that you look into your discharges.\n\nYours sincerely,\n\nP.S. We are now Old Zhou's Hat Shop. Your staff are most welcome — 10% off with a company badge.",
	"[center]照片上,一个笑得有点腼腆的男人,搂着一位笑得很甜的女人。\n\n[b]背面[/b]\nSarah 生日快乐 · 2021.2.3[/center]": "[center]In the photo, a slightly shy man has his arm around a sweetly smiling woman.\n\n[b]On the back[/b]\nHappy birthday, Sarah · 2021.2.3[/center]",
	"[i](一张泛黄的信纸,折痕很深,被小心地夹在塑料袋里。)[/i]\n\n对不起。\n你是个好人。\n但我真的接受不了爷孙恋。\n\n—— 2000.11.4\n\n[i](背面是另一种笔迹,新一些:)[/i]\n“等我有了头发……”": "[i](A yellowed sheet of letter paper with deep creases, carefully kept in a plastic sleeve.)[/i]\n\nI'm sorry.\nYou're a good person.\nBut I really can't date someone who looks like my grandpa.\n\n— 2000.11.4\n\n[i](On the back, in different, newer handwriting:)[/i]\n\"Once I have hair...\"",
	"[i](铅笔写的,字歪歪扭扭。纸被揉成过一团。)[/i]\n\n实验室的叔叔:\n我叫小磊,三年级。\n我在学校被叫“小卤蛋”。\n请把我的头发还给我。\n\n附:一根我的头发。(最后一根)\n\n[i](信封里,真的夹着一根头发。)[/i]": "[i](Written in pencil, the letters wobbly. The paper has been crumpled into a ball before.)[/i]\n\nDear lab mister,\nMy name is Xiao Lei, I'm in third grade.\nAt school they call me \"Little Boiled Egg.\"\nPlease give me back my hair.\n\nP.S. Here is one of my hairs. (The last one.)\n\n[i](There really is a single hair tucked inside the envelope.)[/i]",
	"一块锋利的镜子碎片。里面映着的你,好像比你慢了一点。": "A sharp shard of mirror. The you reflected in it seems a little slower than you.",
	"从修女头顶掉出来的门禁卡。印着:CLICHÉ LAB · 持卡人:博士。": "A keycard that fell out of the nun's head. Printed on it: CLICHÉ LAB · Holder: The Doctor.",
	"博士的鬼魂|谢谢你。替全世界的秃头,谢谢你。": "Doctor's Ghost|Thank you. On behalf of bald people everywhere, thank you.",
	"合照拼好了。背面写着:Sarah 生日快乐 · 2021.2.3": "The photo is whole again. On the back: Happy birthday, Sarah · 2021.2.3",
	"后门从外面锁着。\n门缝下,有一道湿漉漉的拖痕,一直通向河边。": "The back door is locked from the outside.\nUnder it, a wet drag mark leads all the way down to the river.",
	"弟子1号|……我不用再让所有人变秃了。": "Disciple #1|...I don't have to make everyone bald anymore.",
	"按正确配比调出的生发剂,在瓶里泛着金色。\n这一瓶,能让他放下一切。": "A hair tonic mixed to the exact ratio, glowing gold in the bottle.\nThis one bottle could make him let go of everything.",
	"捡起信件": "Pick up the letter",
	"收音机(断断续续):\n“Remember to clean the sink after you shower.”": "The radio (crackling):\n\"Remember to clean the sink after you shower.\"",
	"柜门弹开——半个人体模型扑了出来。": "The door bursts open — half a mannequin lunges out.",
	"水龙头流出一股发黄的水。生发剂味。\n……你的手背,好像有点痒。": "Yellowish water trickles out. It smells like hair tonic.\n...The back of your hand feels a little itchy.",
	"爆炸头假发。标签:“实验 #212 的副作用,请勿靠近明火。”": "An afro wig. The label reads: \"Side effect of Experiment #212. Keep away from open flames.\"",
	"相框里只有半张照片:一个笑得有点腼腆的男人。\n另一半被撕掉了。": "Only half a photo in the frame: a slightly shy-looking man.\nThe other half has been torn off.",
	"碎片没入石像的胸口。她跪了下去。\n头顶,有个红色的按钮在闪。": "The shard sinks into the statue's chest. She drops to her knees.\nOn top of her head, a red button is blinking.",
	"背面写着:\nSarah 生日快乐 · 2021.2.3": "On the back:\nHappy birthday, Sarah · 2021.2.3",
	"跑。右边——厕所!": "Run. Right side — the restroom!",
	"镇上的人寄给实验室的信。一直没人拆,也没人回。": "Letters the townspeople sent to the lab. Nobody ever opened them, and nobody ever replied.",
	"镇民来信": "Letters from Townsfolk",
	"镇民来信 {n}/{t}": "Letters from Townsfolk {n}/{t}",
	"镜子里的你,慢了半拍。": "Your reflection is half a beat behind.",
	"马桶被一大团头发堵死了。\n每 40 天,这里就会堵一次。": "The toilet is choked with a huge wad of hair.\nEvery 40 days, it clogs again.",
	"> 实验记录 #0417\n> 负责人:博士\n>\n> 米诺地尔 5 + 丙二醇 30 + 乙醇 40 + 蒸馏水 20 的配方确实能促进头发再生。\n> 但会引发全身毛发疯狂生长(参见 2025.8.13 日记)。\n>\n> 缺失成分:抑毛因子-K (Inhibitor-K)。\n> 用量:——未录入——(博士:写在我自己的本子上了)\n> 警告:多一分,头发脱落;少一分,浑身长毛。\n> 总量必须恰好是 100 份。\n>\n> (备注:早该想到的……)": "> Experiment Log #0417\n> Lead: The Doctor\n>\n> Minoxidil 5 + Propylene glycol 30 + Ethanol 40 + Distilled water 20 does promote hair regrowth.\n> But it causes wild hair growth all over the body (see diary, 2025.8.13).\n>\n> Missing ingredient: Inhibitor-K.\n> Amount: -- not entered -- (Doctor: it's in my own notebook)\n> Warning: one part too many, the hair falls out; one too few, you grow fur everywhere.\n> The total must be exactly 100 parts.\n>\n> (Note: should have thought of this sooner...)",
	"Cliché 实验室 · 荣誉出品": "Proudly brought to you by Cliché Laboratory",
	"Veronica|……我尽量。": "Veronica|...I'll do my best.",
	"[b]2025.12.1[/b]\n\n停用三个月。头发比用药前还少。\n枕头上、下水道里、水槽里,到处都是。\n\n这一批废液,和以前一样,从后门旁边的排污阀放进了河里。\n每次拧开它,我都跟自己说:最后一次。": "[b]2025.12.1[/b]\n\nThree months off it. Less hair than before I ever started.\nOn the pillow, in the drain, in the sink. Everywhere.\n\nThis batch of waste went into the river like all the others, through the drain valve by the back door.\nEvery time I open it, I tell myself: this is the last time.",
	"[b]2026.3.15[/b]\n\n积蓄见底了。\n配方改到第 17 版,我终于知道缺的是什么:抑毛因子-K。有了它,头发只会长在该长的地方。\n可我已经没力气再试了。前四样加起来是 95 份,总量必须是 100——剩下的,就是它。\n\n今天在街上遇见了 Sarah,用着我的赡养费。她身边那个男人,光头,亮得能反光,胳膊比我的腿还粗。\n她看了我一眼。就一眼。然后笑了。\n\n我恨她。我更恨镜子里的我。\n\n留给这个世界最后一句话:\n[b]“Remember to clean the sink after you shower.”[/b]": "[b]2026.3.15[/b]\n\nThe savings are gone.\nFormula version 17, and I finally know what's missing: Inhibitor-K. With it, hair only grows where it's supposed to.\nBut I have no strength left to try. The first four add up to 95 parts, and the total has to be 100 — the rest is Inhibitor-K.\n\nI ran into Sarah on the street today, spending my alimony. The man beside her: bald, so shiny it reflected the sun, arms thicker than my legs.\nShe looked at me. Just once. Then she smiled.\n\nI hate her. I hate the man in the mirror more.\n\nMy last words to this world:\n[b]\"Remember to clean the sink after you shower.\"[/b]",
	"[b]水样检测报告 · 附录 B[/b]\n委托 #0417 · 柳湾镇\n\n检出物:米诺地尔(Minoxidil),超标约 2000 倍。\n\n米诺地尔原本是一种口服降压药。医生发现,吃药的病人汗毛越长越多,于是把它改成了外用生发水。\n\n已知特性:\n① 刚开始用,会先把旧头发顶掉;\n② 一旦停用,靠它长出来的头发,几个月内全部掉回去;\n③ 不挑地方。头发、眉毛、胡子,一视同仁;\n④ 小孩对它特别敏感。": "[b]Water Sample Report · Appendix B[/b]\nCase #0417 · Willow Bend\n\nDetected: minoxidil, about 2000x the safe limit.\n\nMinoxidil started out as an oral blood-pressure drug. Doctors noticed their patients kept getting hairier, so it was turned into a topical hair-growth treatment.\n\nKnown properties:\n① In the first weeks, it pushes old hair out before new hair grows;\n② Once you stop, all the hair it grew falls out again within a few months;\n③ It doesn't care where. Scalp, eyebrows, mustache — all the same to it;\n④ Children are especially sensitive to it.",
	"[b]结论[/b]\n\n柳湾镇的人掉头发,不是因为水里“有”米诺地尔,而是因为它“时有时无”。\n\n排放记录:上游大约每 40 天排一次。排的时候,全镇头发疯长;一停,就整片整片地掉。一次比一次严重。\n\n那个七岁的女孩,家离排污口最近,个子最小,喝的井水最多——所以她身上,“长”赢过了“掉”。\n至于抛硬币的传言:和米诺地尔无关。大概。\n\n[i]另:镇长说,这几个月镇上很多人给实验室写过信,一封回音都没有。[/i]": "[b]Conclusion[/b]\n\nWillow Bend isn't losing its hair because there IS minoxidil in the water. It's because the minoxidil comes and goes.\n\nDischarge records: upstream releases roughly once every 40 days. During a release, everyone's hair grows like crazy; when it stops, it falls out in clumps. Worse each time.\n\nThe seven-year-old lives closest to the outflow, is the smallest, and drinks the most well water — so for her, the growing won out over the falling.\nAs for the coin-toss rumor: unrelated to minoxidil. Probably.\n\n[i]P.S. The mayor says lots of townspeople wrote letters to the lab these past months. Not one got an answer.[/i]",
	"[b]获得:[/b]\n\n· [b]博士的日记[/b]\n  字迹越往后越潦草。[i]关掉这个窗口后会自动打开。[/i]\n\n· [b]空枪[/b]\n  没有子弹。按 Q 扣一下扳机,咔哒声能把人引开。\n\n[i]两样东西之后都可以按 Tab 在背包里查看。[/i]": "[b]Obtained:[/b]\n\n· [b]The Doctor's Diary[/b]\n  The handwriting gets messier toward the end. [i]It will open automatically when you close this window.[/i]\n\n· [b]Empty Gun[/b]\n  No bullets. Press Q to pull the trigger — the click can lure people away.\n\n[i]You can look at both later in your inventory (Tab).[/i]",
	"[i](信封没有拆过。你小心地撕开了它。)[/i]\n\n您好,冒昧打扰。\n我是河边那户人家的妈妈。我女儿今年七岁,这两个月,嘴唇上长出了一撇小胡子。\n现在镇上都在传,说她刚出生时我们分不清男女,是抛硬币决定怎么养的。\n\n我想澄清一下:我们没有抛过硬币。\n(是她自己抛的。她很喜欢那枚硬币。)\n\n医生说,可能是接触了什么药。镇上的人都说,是从上游来的。\n如果是你们排的,能不能请你们停下来。\n\n谢谢。\n—— 一个很想澄清的妈妈": "[i](The envelope was never opened. You carefully tear it open.)[/i]\n\nHello, sorry to bother you.\nI'm the mom from the house by the river. My daughter is seven, and these past two months she's grown a little mustache.\nNow the whole town is saying that when she was born we couldn't tell if she was a boy or a girl, so we tossed a coin to decide how to raise her.\n\nI'd like to clear that up: we never tossed a coin.\n(She did. She loves that coin.)\n\nThe doctor says she might have been exposed to some kind of drug. Everyone says it comes from upstream.\nIf it's you, could you please stop?\n\nThank you.\n— A mom who would really like to clear things up",
	"【调查委托 #0417】\n\n委托人:柳湾镇镇长(本人已秃)。\n\n现象:三个月内,全镇八成居民开始掉头发。\n镇上唯一的理发店,已经改行卖帽子了。": "[CASE FILE #0417]\n\nClient: the Mayor of Willow Bend (bald himself).\n\nSymptom: within three months, 80% of residents have started losing their hair.\nThe town's only barbershop now sells hats.",
	"一张褪色的药品广告。米诺地尔——原本是降血压的药,吃了的人却意外长出了头发。\n广告上那个男人的脸,被人用记号笔画满了头发,眼睛被划掉了。\n旁边有人用红笔写着:“停药之后,它会全部掉回去。”": "A faded drug ad. Minoxidil — originally a blood-pressure pill, but the people who took it grew hair.\nSomeone has scribbled hair all over the smiling man's face in marker and crossed out his eyes.\nNext to it, in red: \"Once you stop, it all falls out again.\"",
	"一顶金黄色的大背头假发,蓬得很不科学,靠一整罐发胶撑着。\n标签:“抗风等级:飓风”。\n……好眼熟。像某个政治人物。": "A golden comb-over wig, impossibly fluffy, held up by an entire can of hairspray.\nThe label reads: \"Wind rating: Hurricane.\"\n...Looks familiar. Like a certain politician.",
	"上游不再排放。河水一天天清了。\n全镇的头发,又掉了最后一次——然后,真的长回来了。": "The discharges upstream stopped. Day by day, the river ran clearer.\nThe whole town lost its hair one last time — and then it truly grew back.",
	"你把那封一直没人拆的信,还给了女孩的妈妈。": "You return the unopened letter to the girl's mom.",
	"你是 Veronica,环境调查员。\n你的任务:找到排放源,让它停下来。": "You are Veronica, environmental investigator.\nYour job: find the source of the discharge and make it stop.",
	"保险箱开了": "The safe is open",
	"停药之后,\n它会全部掉回去。": "Once you stop,\nit all falls out again.",
	"关闭排污阀": "Close the drain valve",
	"刺入": "stab",
	"原本是降血压的药。\n服用者意外长出了浓密的头发。": "Originally a blood-pressure pill.\nPatients unexpectedly grew thick hair.",
	"女孩的妈妈|……他一封都没看啊。": "The Girl's Mom|...He never read a single one, huh.",
	"女孩的妈妈|那你能不能帮我跟镇上的人说一声:我们真的没抛过硬币。": "The Girl's Mom|Then could you tell everyone in town for me: we really never tossed a coin.",
	"小女孩|你就是那个调查员?": "Little Girl|Are you the investigator?",
	"小女孩|才不是呢。硬币是我自己的。": "Little Girl|That's not true. The coin is mine.",
	"小女孩|镇上的人都说,我刚出生的时候,爸妈分不清我是男孩还是女孩,就抛硬币决定怎么养我。": "Little Girl|Everyone in town says that when I was born, Mom and Dad couldn't tell if I was a boy or a girl, so they tossed a coin to decide how to raise me.",
	"弟子1号带着完美生发剂,挨家挨户地送。\n这一次,一滴都没有排进河里。": "Disciple #1 took the perfect tonic door to door.\nThis time, not a single drop went into the river.",
	"拧紧": "tighten",
	"排放源:上游,河边一座废弃的实验室——Cliché Lab。": "Source: upstream. An abandoned laboratory by the river — Cliché Lab.",
	"排污阀 · 每 40 天开启": "DRAIN VALVE · OPENS EVERY 40 DAYS",
	"查看海报": "Look at the poster",
	"水样检测:河水里有大量米诺地尔——一种本来让人“长”头发的药。\n\n镇长在电话里的原话:\n“那为什么我们全秃了?!”": "Water sample: the river is full of minoxidil — a drug that's supposed to make hair GROW.\n\nThe mayor's exact words on the phone:\n\"Then why are we all bald?!\"",
	"清晨的河边。上游的排污口,终于不再往外冒黄水了。": "Morning by the river. The outflow upstream has finally stopped spitting yellow water.",
	"米诺地尔 · 让头发回来": "Bring your hair back",
	"缺失的成分是:抑毛因子-K。\n用量没有录进电脑。博士的日记里,也许写了。": "The missing ingredient is Inhibitor-K.\nThe amount was never entered into the computer. Maybe it's in the Doctor's diary.",
	"至于那个小女孩——\n镇上关于她的传言,又多了好几个版本。\n她抛出去的那枚硬币,到现在,还在空中转着。": "As for the little girl —\nthe town now has several new versions of the rumor about her.\nThe coin she tossed is still spinning in the air.",
	"调出完美的生发剂。他有了头发,就再也没有理由往河里排废液了。": "Mix the perfect hair tonic. Once he has hair, he'll have no reason left to dump waste into the river.",
	"趁弟子1号离开时:关掉后门旁边的排污阀,再调出完美的生发剂。": "While Disciple #1 is away: close the drain valve by the back door, then mix the perfect hair tonic.",
	"还差一步:关掉后门旁边的排污阀。": "One more thing: close the drain valve by the back door.",
	"连按 [E] 拧紧!  {a}/{b}": "Mash [E] to tighten!  {a}/{b}",
	"连按 ● 拧紧!  {a}/{b}": "Tap ● to tighten!  {a}/{b}",
	"镇上的人寄给实验室的信。\n应该不止这一封。": "A letter the townspeople sent to the lab.\nThere must be more than one.",
	"阀门卡住了,只转了半圈。\n刚才那一下,声音很大。": "The valve jams after half a turn.\nThat was loud.",
	"阀门终于拧死了。管子里传来“咚”的一声闷响。\n……走廊那头,有脚步声在往回跑。": "The valve finally locks shut. A heavy \"thunk\" echoes through the pipe.\n...From the far end of the corridor, footsteps come running back.",
	"附注:镇上还有个七岁的小女孩,长出了一撇小胡子。\n\n镇上传得很玄乎:说她刚出生时,爸妈分不清她是男是女,干脆抛了枚硬币,决定怎么养她。\n(该说法未经证实。)": "Note: there's also a seven-year-old girl in town who has grown a little mustache.\n\nThe town's version of events is quite something: when she was born, her parents couldn't tell whether she was a boy or a girl, so they simply tossed a coin to decide how to raise her.\n(Unverified.)",
	"青绿色的超长双马尾。\n……Miku?!": "Extra-long teal twin tails.\n...Miku?!",
	"[b]2023.11.20[/b]\n\nSarah 又发火了。\n她说我洗完澡从来不清理水槽,下水道这个月第三次被我的头发堵死了。\n她拎着一团湿漉漉的头发站在浴室门口:“你掉的头发,比你在这个家待的时间还多。”\n\n我说我会注意的。\n我没有。": "[b]2023.11.20[/b]\n\nSarah blew up again.\nShe says I never clean the sink after I shower, and that my hair has clogged the drain for the third time this month.\nShe stood in the bathroom doorway holding a wet clump of it: \"Your hair spends more time in this house than you do.\"\n\nI said I'd be more careful.\nI wasn't.",
	"发霉的访客登记表。最后一页只写着:“米诺地尔,第 417 批”。\n登记表下压着一份《柳湾周报》,头条是:《帽子脱销!全镇八成居民出门必戴帽,理发店老板:我也想买一顶》。": "A moldy visitor log. The last page says only: \"Minoxidil, batch 417.\"\nUnder it lies a copy of the Willow Bend Weekly. Headline: \"Hats Sold Out! 80% of Residents Won't Leave Home Without One. Barber: 'I'd Like to Buy One Too.'\"",
	"她在门外徘徊。趁现在,把厕所仔细搜一遍——镜子好像不太对劲。": "She's pacing outside the door. Search the restroom while you can — something about the mirror seems off.",
	"清洁工具": "JANITOR",
	"脚步声停在了门口。\n……她在找你。": "The footsteps stop at the door.\n...She's looking for you.",
	"跑进右边的厕所,找个地方躲起来!": "Run into the restroom on the right and find somewhere to hide!",
	"躲进清洁工具柜": "Hide in the janitor's closet",
	"门被推开了。她进来了。": "The door swings open. She's coming in.",
}
